lass=\"rise rise-2 mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-lg\"> I'm Adil Ali — a full-stack developer with 2 years 11 months of experience shipping CRM platforms, REST APIs, and dashboards. I take projects from database schema to a deployed, Dockerised app running behind CI/CD — not just the frontend. </p><div class=\"rise rise-3 mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"btn btn-primary\"><i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane\"></i> Hire me </a><a href=\"/projects\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\"> View work <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right text-xs\"></i></a><a href=\"/Adil-Ali-CV.pdf\" download=\"\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\"><i class=\"fas fa-download text-xs\"></i> Download CV </a></div><div class=\"rise rise-4 mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-xl grid-cols-3 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\" style=\"background: var(--border);\"><div class=\"px-4 py-5\" style=\"background: var(--surface);\"><div class=\"display text-2xl font-bold text-accent sm:text-3xl\">2y 11m</div><div class=\"mono mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\">Experience</div></div><div class=\"px-4 py-5\" style=\"background: var(--surface);\"><div class=\"display text-2xl font-bold text-accent sm:text-3xl\">13</div><div class=\"mono mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\">Projects</div></div><div class=\"px-4 py-5\" style=\"background: var(--surface);\"><div class=\"display text-2xl font-bold text-accent sm:text-3xl\">Vue · Laravel</div><div class=\"mono mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\">Core stack</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"band\"><div class=\"wrap py-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between\"><span class=\"mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted\">Daily toolkit</span><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-7 gap-y-3\"><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">Laravel</span><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">Vue.js</span><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">PHP</span><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">MySQL</span><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">Docker</span><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">Git</span><span class=\"mono text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: var(--text);\">REST APIs</span></div></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"section scroll-mt-20\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">What I do</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\">Services I deliver</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted\"> Hire me for a focused piece or own the whole stack end-to-end. Every engagement ships clean, documented, and deployed. </p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"card card-hover p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--accent-strong);\"><i class=\"fas fa-layer-group text-lg\"></i></div><div class=\"mono mt-5 text-xs text-muted\">01</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Full-Stack Web Apps</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">End-to-end Laravel + Vue.js applications — CRM, dashboards, and SaaS platforms built to scale.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--accent-strong);\"><i class=\"fas fa-plug text-lg\"></i></div><div class=\"mono mt-5 text-xs text-muted\">02</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">REST API Development</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Clean, documented, secure APIs and third-party integrations that other systems can rely on.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--accent-strong);\"><i class=\"fas fa-display text-lg\"></i></div><div class=\"mono mt-5 text-xs text-muted\">03</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Frontend Engineering</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Responsive, accessible interfaces in Vue.js + Tailwind that match your design pixel-for-pixel.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--accent-strong);\"><i class=\"fas fa-server text-lg\"></i></div><div class=\"mono mt-5 text-xs text-muted\">04</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">DevOps &amp; Deployment</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Dockerised environments, CI/CD pipelines, and VPS/Nginx hosting so releases are repeatable.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--accent-strong);\"><i class=\"fas fa-gauge-high text-lg\"></i></div><div class=\"mono mt-5 text-xs text-muted\">05</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Performance &amp; Fixes</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Query optimisation, refactoring, and speed audits to make existing apps fast and stable.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--accent-strong);\"><i class=\"fas fa-screwdriver-wrench text-lg\"></i></div><div class=\"mono mt-5 text-xs text-muted\">06</div><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Maintenance &amp; Support</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Ongoing feature work, bug fixes, and reliable maintenance for live production systems.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"band section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Selected work</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\">Recent projects</h2></div><a href=\"/projects\" class=\"link-accent mono text-sm\">All projects <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right text-xs\"></i></a></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"card card-hover group overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560518883-ce09059eeffa?w=640&amp;h=400&amp;fit=crop\" alt=\"Pak Properties\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\"><span class=\"tag absolute left-3 top-3\" style=\"background: var(--surface); color: var(--accent-strong);\">● Live</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Pak Properties</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">A real-estate marketplace for Pakistan — listings, advanced search, and a clean experience for buyers and sellers.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"tag\">Vue.js</span><span class=\"tag\">Laravel</span><span class=\"tag\">MySQL</span></div><a href=\"https://pakproperties.pk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link-accent mono mt-5 inline-flex text-sm\">Visit site <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-xs\"></i></a></div></article><article class=\"card card-hover group overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2);\"><img src=\"/images/MEDEXCORE.webp\" alt=\"MedexCore\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\"><span class=\"tag absolute left-3 top-3\" style=\"background: var(--surface); color: var(--accent-strong);\">● Live</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">MedexCore</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Healthcare management platform for patient data, appointments, and medical records — secure and efficient for clinics.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"tag\">Laravel</span><span class=\"tag\">Livewire</span><span class=\"tag\">Tailwind</span></div><a href=\"https://medexcore.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link-accent mono mt-5 inline-flex text-sm\">Visit site <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-xs\"></i></a></div></article><article class=\"card card-hover group overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: var(--surface-2);\"><img src=\"/images/pakistancooling.webp\" alt=\"Pakistan Cooling Center\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\"><span class=\"tag absolute left-3 top-3\" style=\"background: var(--surface); color: var(--accent-strong);\">● Live</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Pakistan Cooling Center</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">E-commerce platform for air-conditioning and cooling solutions — browse, compare, and purchase with a smooth UX.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"tag\">Vue.js</span><span class=\"tag\">Laravel</span><span class=\"tag\">E-commerce</span></div><a href=\"https://pakistancooling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link-accent mono mt-5 inline-flex text-sm\">Visit site <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-xs\"></i></a></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">How I work</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\">A process built for remote clients</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted\">Clear communication, small shippable increments, and no surprises at handover.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\" style=\"background: var(--border);\"><div class=\"p-7\" style=\"background: var(--surface);\"><div class=\"mono text-3xl font-bold\" style=\"color: var(--border-strong);\">01</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-base font-semibold\">Discovery</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">We scope the goal, users, and constraints. You get an honest plan, timeline, and fixed quote.</p></div><div class=\"p-7\" style=\"background: var(--surface);\"><div class=\"mono text-3xl font-bold\" style=\"color: var(--border-strong);\">02</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-base font-semibold\">Build in sprints</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Work ships in small increments you can review early — no black box, no end-of-project surprises.</p></div><div class=\"p-7\" style=\"background: var(--surface);\"><div class=\"mono text-3xl font-bold\" style=\"color: var(--border-strong);\">03</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-base font-semibold\">Test &amp; deploy</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Tested, Dockerised, and deployed via CI/CD to your VPS or cloud with monitoring in place.</p></div><div class=\"p-7\" style=\"background: var(--surface);\"><div class=\"mono text-3xl font-bold\" style=\"color: var(--border-strong);\">04</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-base font-semibold\">Handover &amp; support</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Clean code, documentation, and a walkthrough — plus ongoing support if you need it.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"band section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"card relative overflow-hidden p-8 text-center sm:p-14\"><div class=\"grid-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-50\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"mx-auto max-w-xl text-2xl